"language":"Arabic"}]},{"columns":[{"content":"Marou[isipi `nce[isws@ &nbsp;`nje nihertikoc tyrou etcwf@ &nbsp;eucwtem `mPauloc@ &nbsp;je `anok oucebi qen pimah `smyn `n`ehoou.","language":"Coptic"},{"content":"Let all the defiled heretics: &nbsp;be put to shame and scorned: &nbsp;and let them hear Paul saying: &nbsp;“I am circumcised on the eighth day.”","language":"English"},{"content":"ليخزَ وليفتضح:  كل الهراطقة الأنجاس:  وليسمعوا بولس قائلاً:  \"أنا مختون في اليوم الثامن.","language":"Arabic"}]},{"columns":[{"content":"Ef]myini nan `ejen P=,=c@ &nbsp;je afswp `erof `mpicebi@ &nbsp;qen pimah `smyn `nehoou@ &nbsp;kata `vnomoc `mMw`ucyc.","language":"Coptic"},{"content":"He told us about Christ: &nbsp;that He accepted the circumcision: &nbsp;on the eighth day: &nbsp;according to the Law of Moses.","language":"English"},{"content":"ويدلنا على المسيح:  أنه قبِل الختان:  في اليوم الثامن:  كناموس موسى.","language":"Arabic"}]},{"columns":[{"content":"A=l A=l@ &nbsp;A=l A=l@ &nbsp;I=y=c P=,=c `Psyri `mV]@ &nbsp;afswp `erof `mpicebi.","language":"Coptic"},{"content":"Alleluia.  Alleluia: &nbsp;Alleluia.  Alleluia: &nbsp;Jesus Christ, the Son of God: &nbsp;accepted to Himself circumcision.","language":"English"},{"content":"الليلويا. الليلويا:  الليلويا. الليلويا:  يسوع المسيح إبن الله:  قبِل إليه الختان.","language":"Arabic"}]}]}}]}},{"id":"psalm-response-feast-of-circumcision","name":"Psalm Response","formats":{"1":[{"name":"Psalm Response","contentType":"Text","content":{"paragraphs":[{"columns":[{"content":"Alleluia. &nbsp;Alleluia: &nbsp;Jesus Christ, the Son of God: &nbsp;accepted to Himself circumcision: &nbsp;Alleluia.  Alleluia.","language":"English"},{"content":"A=l A=l@ &nbsp;I=y=c P=,=c `Psyri `mV]@ &nbsp;afswp `erof `mpicebi@ &nbsp;A=l A=l.","language":"Coptic"},{"content":"الليلويا.  الليلويا:  يسوع المسيح إبن الله:  قبِل إليه الختان:   الليلويا.  الليلويا.","language":"Arabic"}]}],"contentType":"TextContent"}}]}},{"id":"gospel-response-feast-of-circumcision